      "message": "I thought you\u0027d add another member to StringListAttribute instead of putting these in OsValues: if you do it this way, what will happen is that exactly one branch of the select() will be taken so in the Android/arm64 configuration you\u0027ll have either android_src.c or android_arm64_src.c, but if I read arch.go correctly, the correct solution is to include both:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/android/arch.go;l\u003d1329\n\nand result is used here:\n\nhttps://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/soong/android/arch.go;l\u003d1390\n\nIOW, the desired output here is \n\nselect({\n  \":android\":\n  \":linux_bionic\":\n  \":default\":\n}) + select({\n  \":android_arm\":\n  \":android_arm64\":\n  \":linux_bionic_arm64\":\n  \":default\":\n})",
